## File structure

```
magic-scarf-site/
├── index.html                 (single self-contained file — HTML + CSS + JS inline)
├── README.md
├── notes.md                   (audit + assumptions)
├── notes-tech.md              (this file)
├── notes-product.md
├── notes-csm.md
├── scorecard.md
├── improvement-suggestions.md
├── qa-checklist.md
├── component-image-sheet.xlsx
