## JS function reference

| Function | What it does |
|---|---|
| `route()` | Reads `location.hash`, sets active nav, swaps view, calls `renderPlp` / `renderPdp` / `renderCart` as needed |
| `setActiveNav(path)` | Highlights matching nav item with `.is-active` |
| `showView(viewId)` | Toggles `.is-active` on `.view` elements; scrolls to top |
| `renderCatalogGrid(targetId)` | Renders the 17-tile Magic Scarf Catalog into a target div |
| `renderSeasonal()` | Renders the 6-tile seasonal rail |
| `renderShows(targetId, list)` | Renders trade-show grid |
| `renderPlp(slug)` | Builds PLP: title, audited description, subcat pills, sidebar filters, 16-product grid, count, pagination |
| `renderPdp(sku)` | Builds PDP: gallery, thumbs, 47-color variant grid, audit-style description, accordions, related-products always-fills-to-4 |
| `renderCart()` | Builds cart with 3 sample line items pulled from `SAMPLE_PRODUCTS` |
| `renderSale()` | Sale PLP — first 12 products as discounted |
| `productCardHtml(p, idx)` | Single product card markup — used by every grid |
| `realProductImg(p, idx)` | Returns `https://www.magicscarf.com/i/p/<pid>/<n>/300x300.jpg` |
| `mainProductImg(p)` | Returns `https://www.magicscarf.com/stores/common_files/products/main_image_<pid>.jpg` |
| `imgFor(slug, idx)` | Category-level fallback image |
| `colorChip(name)` | Returns hex from `SWATCH` map |
| `openLogin()` / `closeLogin()` | Toggle login modal |
| `openRegister()` / `closeRegister()` | Toggle register modal |
| `closeDrawer()` | Close mobile drawer |
| `toggleAccordion(btn)` | Toggle PDP accordion item |

