## Responsive breakpoints

```
≤480px  — extra-tight phone (cards 2-col, hero stacked, drawer-only nav)
≤760px  — phone (header collapses, footer 2-col)
≤1100px — tablet (nav-primary collapses to drawer, PLP becomes 1-col body, grid 3-col)
≥1100px — desktop (full nav, 4-col grid, sidebar PLP)
